":" shall never","strong":"H5704"},{"text":"","strong":"H5769"},{"text":" depart","strong":"H5493"},{"text":" from thine house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":"; because","strong":"H6118"},{"text":" thou hast despised","strong":"H959"},{"text":" me, and hast taken","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" the wife","strong":"H802"},{"text":" of Uriah","strong":"H223"},{"text":" the Hittite","strong":"H2850"},{"text":" to be thy wife","strong":"H802"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8297,"title":"II Samuel 12:11","segments":["Thus saith the LORD, Behold, I will raise up evil against thee out of thine own house, and I will take thy wives before thine eyes, and give [them] unto thy neighbour, and he shall lie with thy wives in the sight of this sun."],"ref":"II Samuel 12:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"Thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", Behold, I will raise up","strong":"H6965"},{"text":" evil","strong":"H7451"},{"text":" against thee out of thine own house","strong":"H1004"},{"text":", and I will take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" thy wives","strong":"H802"},{"text":" before thine eyes","strong":"H5869"},{"text":", and give","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" [them] unto thy neighbour","strong":"H7453"},{"text":", and he shall lie","strong":"H7901"},{"text":" with thy wives","strong":"H802"},{"text":" in the sight","strong":"H5869"},{"text":" of this sun","strong":"H8121"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8298,"title":"II Samuel 12:12","segments":["For thou didst [it] secretly: but I will do this thing before all Israel, and before the sun."],"ref":"II Samuel 12:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"For thou didst","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" [it] secretly","strong":"H5643"},{"text":": but I will do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" this thing","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" before all Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":", and before the sun","strong":"H8121"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8299,"title":"II Samuel 12:13","segments":["And David said unto Nathan, I have sinned against the LORD. And