":"H2416"},{"text":", I fasted","strong":"H6684"},{"text":" and wept","strong":"H1058"},{"text":": for I said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Who can tell","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" [whether] GOD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" will be gracious","strong":"H2603"},{"text":"","strong":"H2603"},{"text":" to me, that the child","strong":"H3206"},{"text":" may live","strong":"H2416"},{"text":"?"}]},{"id":8309,"title":"II Samuel 12:23","segments":["But now he is dead, wherefore should I fast? can I bring him back again? I shall go to him, but he shall not return to me."],"ref":"II Samuel 12:23","verse":23,"words":[{"text":"But now he is dead","strong":"H4191"},{"text":", wherefore should I fast","strong":"H6684"},{"text":"? can","strong":"H3201"},{"text":" I bring him back again","strong":"H7725"},{"text":"? I shall go","strong":"H1980"},{"text":" to him, but he shall not return","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" to me."}]},{"id":8310,"title":"II Samuel 12:24","segments":["And David comforted Bathsheba his wife, and went in unto her, and lay with her: and she bare a son, and he called his name Solomon: and the LORD loved him."],"ref":"II Samuel 12:24","verse":24,"words":[{"text":"And David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" comforted","strong":"H5162"},{"text":" Bathsheba","strong":"H1339"},{"text":" his wife","strong":"H802"},{"text":", and went in","strong":"H935"},{"text":" unto her, and lay","strong":"H7901"},{"text":" with her: and she bare","strong":"H3205"},{"text":" a son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":", and he called","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" his name","strong":"H8034"},{"text":" Solomon","strong":"H8010"},{"text":": and the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" loved","strong":"H157"},{"text":" him."}]},{"id":8311,"title":"II Samuel 12:25","segments":["And he sent by the hand of Nathan the prophet; and he called his name Jedidiah, because of the LORD. {Jedidiah: that is, Beloved of the LORD}"],"ref":"II Samuel 12:25","verse":25,"words":[{"text":"And he sent","strong":"H7971"},{"tex